OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 28 MAY
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Miles Davis
OL,5,     F100
OL,6,     GKate Molleson and American jazz
OL,7,     Gcritic Nate Chinen explore a
OL,8,     Gtumultuous and pivotal period in
OL,9,     Gthe story of Miles Davis.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GKatie Derham welcomes viola
OL,12,     Gplayer Rosalind Ventris & pianist
OL,13,     GNigel Hutchison as they perform
OL,14,     Glive ahead of Rosalind's
OL,15,     Gappearance at the Elgar Festival.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,19,     Gfavourites, including music by
OL,20,     GAmy Beach, Henry Purcell and
OL,21,     GJohannes Brahms.
