OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 28 MAY
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GAs part of Wigmore Hall's 125th
OL,6,     GAnniversary Festival, French
OL,7,     Gpianist Alexandre Kantorow plays
OL,8,     GLiszt, Chopin and Beethoven.
OL,9,G2145FThe Essay: Miles Davis 100 -
OL,10,     FMiles Beyond
OL,11,     GJournalist Kevin Le Gendre
OL,12,     Gexplores how Miles Davis's image
OL,13,     Gevolved alongside his music, and
OL,14,     Gbecame a fashion icon.
OL,15,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,16,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,17,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,18,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,19,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,20,     Geverything in between.
