OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 28 MAY
OL,4,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,5,     GSoweto's fourth and final guest
OL,6,     Gof the week, trumpeter, vocalist
OL,7,     Gand producer Emma-Jean Thackray,
OL,8,     Gpays homage to Miles Davis
OL,9,     Gthrough three albums that she
OL,10,     Gdeeply appreciates.
OL,11,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,12,     GPianist Beatrice Rana joins the
OL,13,     GGerman Symphony Orchestra, Berlin
OL,14,     Gand conductor Manfred Honeck in
OL,15,     GTchaikovsky's Piano concerto no 1
OL,16,     Gfollowed by Shostakovich's Fifth
OL,17,     GSymphony.
